  "q": "In a uniprocessor computer system, there exist three processes that alternate between 20ms CPU bursts and 80ms I/O bursts. These processes were created around the same time, and their I/O operations can be executed concurrently. Given a Round Robin scheduling algorithm with a time quantum of 10ms, what would be the CPU utilization over an extended duration for this system?",
