  "q": "Identify the heap from the following sequences and determine it is min or max binary heap (a) 1, 3, 2, 4, 6, 5 (b) 6,5,3,4,2,1 (c) 30,12,90,8,15 (d) Jack, Queen, King, Rahul, Frick, Laxman (e) Queen, laxman, king, Frick, Eigen, Hive",
